5.9. Group’s growth strategy


            Product development
            The Group’s development strategy assumes constant and sustainable expenditure on the further
            development of the products, in particular on

                a)   the functional development of the application;
                b)   new communication channels:
                     • development of the "ticket" system consisting in collecting information from various
                       communication channels with the customer to one customer service management
                       system;
                     • the functionality of the system will allow customers to further improve the customer-
                       seller relationship, and ultimately, increase sales;
                     • mobile systems;
                     • social media;
                     • integrated communicator.

                c)   tools for larger companies, the so-called "Data driven";
                d)   emphasis on automation and the use of AI solutions.

